ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi195: Single ADVANCED_FACE on PLANE in CLOSED_SHELL; outer EDGE_LOOP has 4 LINE edges; E0-E2 form a near-closed triangle-ish path ending at (0, 1e-6, 0); E3 is a 1e-6-long spur from (0,1e-6,0) back to (0,0,0); CheckClosed returns false but cannot distinguish spur vs genuine gap — open-tail-vs-spur IS the mechanism; EDGE_LOOP IS wired into FACE_OUTER_BOUND -> ADVANCED_FACE in CLOSED_SHELL — never orphaned */
